# Platform facts are NOT committed. They name a live environment — account id,
# load balancer, bastion and node addresses — and this repository is public.
#
# Get them from whoever provisions the machines. In the infrastructure repo:
#
#   make platform-env WORKSPACE=dev > platform/dev.env
#
# platform/<ws>.env.example lists every key the resolver looks for.
platform/*.env

